Server init.

>> x := Blob nýtt: 65 gerð: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := Forrit stilling: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server tengja: (
 Listi nýtt ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Listi nýtt ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x frá: 0 lengd: 1), ný-lína.
x losa.

